"*To see the release notes for all versions, visit the [Qiskit Transpiler "
"Service client release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"transpiler/release-notes).*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Pour voir les notes de version de toutes les versions, consulte les [notes "
"de version du client Qiskit Transpiler "
"Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-transpiler/release-"
"notes).*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Transpiler Service client v0.3.0\n"
msgstr "Client Qiskit Transpiler Service v0.3.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - The Qiskit Transpiler Service leverages IBM Cloud&reg; resources to provide users with the latest transpilation capabilities from the Qiskit SDK. It offers a Python library that helps users seamlessly integrate the service into their current Qiskit patterns and workflows. Perhaps most importantly, the service invites users to experiment with new and improved AI-powered transpiler passes — cutting-edge tools that might be faster and produce better results than traditional transpilation methods. Read the [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ai-transpiler-passes) for more information.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Le Qiskit Transpiler Service exploite les ressources IBM Cloud&reg; pour fournir aux utilisateurs les dernières capacités de transpilation du Qiskit SDK. Il offre une bibliothèque Python qui aide les utilisateurs à intégrer de manière transparente le service dans leurs patterns et workflows Qiskit actuels. Ce qui est peut-être le plus important, c'est que le service invite les utilisateurs à expérimenter des passes de transpileur améliorées et nouvelles propulsées par l'IA — des outils de pointe qui pourraient être plus rapides et produire de meilleurs résultats que les méthodes de transpilation traditionnelles. Lis le [blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/ai-transpiler-passes) pour plus d'informations.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-addons\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"latest-qiskit-addons\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Extensions Qiskit {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recently released two new addons that use classical resources to reduce "
"the quantum resources needed for error mitigation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons récemment publié deux nouvelles extensions qui utilisent des "
"ressources classiques pour réduire les ressources quantiques nécessaires à "
"la mitigation d'erreurs :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"pna/) is a technique for mitigating errors in expectation values by "
"absorbing the inverses of the learned noise channels into observables using "
"Pauli propagation. \n"
msgstr ""
"[Propagated noise absorption (PNA)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"pna/) est une technique pour atténuer les erreurs sur les valeurs moyennes "
"(espérances) en absorbant les inverses des canaux de bruit appris dans les "
"observables via la propagation de Pauli. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/) "
"addon uses classical simulations to more tightly bound the sensitivity to "
"errors throughout the circuit. This allows for more efficient, targeted "
"applications of Probabilistic Error Cancellation (PEC) with reduced "
"variance.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'extension [Shaded lightcones (SLC)](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/) utilise des simulations classiques pour délimiter plus étroitement la "
"sensibilité aux erreurs tout au long du circuit. Cela permet des "
"applications plus efficaces et ciblées de l'annulation d'erreur probabiliste"
" (PEC) avec une variance réduite.\n"

